          "brief": "Inside the box the equation becomes −(ħ²/2m)ψ'' = Eψ, which is ψ'' = −k²ψ with k = √(2mE)/ħ. Its general solution is ψ(x) = A sin kx + B cos kx, the same oscillation as a vibrating string.",
